acing ground-floor condo is tucked into a fenced green space that feels like your own little backyard (without any of the work!). At 636 sqft, it's the LARGEST ONE-BEDROOM FLOOR PLAN in The Ion, with 9' ceilings, beautiful BRAND NEW FLOORING, fresh paint throughout and a brand new Samsung washer and dryer (October 2026). The whole home feels bright, cozy and beautifully put together. The kitchen offers stainless steel appliances, lots of cabinetry and a great little alcove designed for a desk, but equally perfect for a coffee bar, cocktail station or just a huge mirror. The bedroom overlooks the greenery and features a WALK-IN CLOSET with built-in organizers, while the living room windows frame the lovely garden-like view and private covered patio. The Ion is PET FRIENDLY and offers a fitness room, social room, guest suite and gas BBQ hookup. If you love the convenience of ground floor living but don't want to feel like you're looking into a parking lot, this is a really special spot! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$159,900"],["Type","Condo"],["Bedrooms","1"],["Bathrooms","1"],["Living area","636 sq ft"],["Year built","2011"],["Condo fee","$397 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Ambleside"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6W0R2"],["MLS® number","E4512787"],["Listed","October 13, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Hot water radiator heat, Baseboard heaters"],["Parking","Stall"],["Condo fee includes","Common Area Maintenance, Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Security, Heat, Water, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Main level",""],["Laundry room","Main level",""]],"courtesy":"Jolene Langelle, RE/MAX Elite","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"ambleside","area":"southwest-edmonton"}